DECISION	D8PACVF7H	PERF	-	trial writes update records, daily_summaries, and user_profiles in one transaction, and dashboards never scan records	anchor=src/storage/db/queries.ts#saveTrialRecord@7ffe29db	revisit_when=dashboard_p95_ms > 200	why=reading 100k+ rows deserializes on the main thread; the cost moves to write time where it is O(1)
DECISION	DN2HSE5J1	ARCH	-	import and clear run in one cross-store IDB transaction, and localStorage keeps only the theme cache	adr=docs/decisions/0003-single-idb-transaction.md	anchor=src/storage/db/importExport.ts#importAllData@58b24743	revisit_when=event:second_persistence_medium	why=two media cannot be atomic, and a failed localStorage write left a half-restored state after IDB had committed
FAIL	XDXNXXYD1	PERF	-	90-day pruning that nulled details destroyed card analytics	anchor=src/storage/db/schema.ts#UnifiedTrialRecord@e6daad07	err=analytics read r.targetHSV[0] and r.userClick of undefined, so color_hue and star_single charts blanked and per-card guards were added	why=the prune assumed details were discardable payload, but it is the primary analytics data
DECISION	DBWDQNF7J	ARCH	-	backup import validates every element before opening the clear transaction; version missing or above DB_VERSION is rejected; unknown cardId normalizes to core	adr=docs/decisions/0005-storage-import-validation.md	anchor=docs/decisions/0005-storage-import-validation.md@75eb0637	revisit_when=event:import_validation_bypass	why=a DataError from put() does not abort queued clear() requests, so failed imports wiped all seven tables while returning false
DECISION	DMM8GRKGD	ARCH	-	duplicate record.id is rejected with DuplicateTrialRecordError and writes nothing; callers must handle the typed error	adr=docs/decisions/0006-trial-record-idempotency.md	anchor=docs/decisions/0006-trial-record-idempotency.md@0e02ab08	revisit_when=event:offline_replay_introduced	why=record put is idempotent but daily summaries and profiles increment, so replay silently double-counts the materialized aggregates

